{"about_the_game":"Dawnshadow is a modern RPG styled after the great 8-bit classics of old. Follow the adventures of &quot;Sai&quot; Wulfgar, a psychic orc with various reptilian pets in the struggle for freedom from imprisonment by the god of darkness and destruction.<br><br>Which sounds silly written out like that.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Experience an original story and world presented in a classic style.<br></li><li>Defeat your foes in a streamlined active-time battle system.<br></li><li>Use Sai's psychic shackles to turn vicious foes into loyal pets.<br></li><li>Craft arms and armor to tailor Sai's abilities to your liking.<br></li><li>Befriend or oppose gods and monsters alike in your quest for freedom.<br></li><li>See two whole endings with 16 - 32 hours of gameplay. Maybe more. Depends how you count.<br></li><li>Speaking of counting, <i>so many</i> powers of 2.<br></li><li>Don't forget...<br></li><li>What was I saying?</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"456a674e237f063f832e5bc26f3da27ec03e4560.jpg","localized_name":"Engulfing Darkness","name":"Engulfing Darkness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/978010/456a674e237f063f832e5bc26f3da27ec03e4560.jpg"},{"icon":"63caff2fa9e8984466f1e26864af8ebe2017dcdb.jpg","localized_name":"Fading Echoes","name":"Fading Echoes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/978010/63caff2fa9e8984466f1e26864af8ebe2017dcdb.jpg"},{"icon":"bedb504c3a9f59a9df263f8928b7351635e43fb7.jpg","localized_name":"Silent Shadows","name":"Silent Shadows","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/978010/bedb504c3a9f59a9df263f8928b7351635e43fb7.jpg"},{"icon":"f1ca378334f78ed155450ead40cc052d2585f355.jpg","localized_name":"Lights in the Darkness","name":"Lights in the Darkness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/978010/f1ca378334f78ed155450ead40cc